# Game Context

Co-op crafting shooter inspired by Volcanoids.

## Core loop

Destroy enemy castles → loot → upgrade own castle → progress story.

## Pillars

- Enemy castles shoot from towers and spawn troops
- Players defend and build their own castle under siege
- Own castle can relocate: a wizard teleports it between available platforms (subway-like hubs)

## Current focus

**Carcass sections:** player/enemy spawn via `CarcassBuilder` — unique columns + shared wall (2 modules/side). B menu: Section, Wall, Window, Door. Door leaf opens on E.

**Parked:** `SquareCastleBuilder` square hull; F9 8×8 layout editor in `Assets/Scripts/Castle/Layout/`. Restore notes: `C:\Feeds\Rules\catapulto-castle-sections-restore.md`.
